  "updateinfo_id": "ALSA-2026:100639",
  "description": "The skopeo command lets you inspect images from container image registries, get images and image layers, and use signatures to create and verify files.   \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * net/[http](http): golang: golang: Denial of Service via crafted HTTP Range headers (CVE-2026-78667)\n  * crypto/tls: golang: crypto/tls: Denial of Service via multiple ECH outer extension references (CVE-2026-97031)\n  * net/[http](http): net/http/internal/http2: golang.org/x/net/http2: net/[http](http): Denial of Service via excessive HTTP/2 SETTINGS frames (CVE-2026-78669)\n  * crypto/x509: golang: crypto/x509: Man-in-the-middle attacks via untrusted intermediate certificates (CVE-2026-111943)\n\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * Drop libtrust_openssl build tag for golang-1.27 compatibility [rhel-10.3.z] (JIRA:RHEL-299627)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
  "fromstr": "packager@almalinux.org",
